              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "подключать (podklyuchát) — \"to connect, to plug in\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Мы подключаем интернет в новой квартире. My podklyucháyem internét v nóvoy kvartíre. We are getting the internet connected in the new flat."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Imperfective; perfective подключить. Подключаться к + dative — to connect to."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "подключать (podklyuchát) is built from под- and ключ \"a key\", inherited from Proto-Slavic ključĭ: to lock one thing into another."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
